    "romaji": "Gendai shakai ni oite, 'yasumu' to iu koto wa tan ni shigoto o shinai joutai o sasu no dewa nai. Ooku no hito wa, kyuujitsu ni nani mo shinaide sugosu koto ni zaiakukan o idakigachi da ga, shinshin o rifuresshu saseru tame no sekkyokuteki na kyuusoku koso ga, tsugi no shigoto no shitsu o takameru no de aru. Tsumari, kyuuyou wa seisansei o iji suru tame no 'gijutsu' no hitotsu to ieru. Jibun ni atta yasumikata o mitsuke, sukejuuru ni kumikomu doryoku ga hitsuyou da.",
