    "romaji": "Kinnen, AI ni yoru gazou seisei ya bunshou shippitsu ga kyuusoku ni fukyuu shite iru. Kore ni yori, dare demo kantan ni kurieitibuna sakuhin o tsukureru you ni natta. Shikashi, AI wa kako no deeta ni motozuite seisei o okonau tame, mattaku atarashii gainen o umidasu koto wa muzukashii to iu shiteki mo aru. Ningen naderaha no dokusousei wa, kizon no waku ni toraware nai shikou kara umareru mono de ari, AI wa sore o hokan suru tsuuru ni suginai. Kongo, ningen wa AI o dono you ni katsuyou shi, mizukara no souzousei o takamete iku ka ga towarete iru.",
