    "romaji": "Chikai shōrai, bijinesu no genba de wa kōritsusei ga jūshi sareru amari, taiman de no komyunikēshon ga keishi sare gachi de aru. Mēru ya chatto wa benri daga, kotoba no ura ni aru komakana nyuansu made wa tsutawari nikui. Toku ni jūyō na anken hodo, chokusetsu atte hanasu koto de gokai o fusegu koto ga dekiru. Dōgu ni tsukawareru no dewa naku, jōkyō ni ōjite shudan o tekisetsu ni erabu shisei ga motomerarete iru.",
