    "romaji": "AI no shinka wa mezamashiku, ooku no bun'ya de ningen no shigoto o ubau no dewa nai ka to kigu sarete iru. Shikashi, AI wa kako no deeta ni motozuite saiteki na kotae o michibikidasu koto ni wa takete iru ga, mattaku atarashii kachi o umidasu chikara wa mada fujuubun da. Tan ni kouritsu o motomeru dake de naku, ningen narade wa no souzousei ya kansei o ikasu koto ga, kore kara no jidai ni wa masumasu fukaketsu ni naru darou. Kekkyoku, gijutsu ni tayorikiru no dewa naku, sore o dou tsukaikonasu ka to iu ningen no shisei ga towarete iru no desu. AI to no kyousei o kangaeru sai ni wa, mizukara no kansei o migaki tsuzukeru doryoku ga hitsuyou da.",
