    "romaji": "Saikin, terewāku o dōnyū suru kigyō ga fuete iru. Jitaku de shigoto ga dekiru koto wa, tsūkin jikan ga nakunaru to iu ōkina ritan ga aru. Sono ippō de, shigoto to shiseikatsu no kubetsu ga tsukinikuku naru to iu kadai mo shiteki sarete iru. Tokuni, kazoku ga iru baai wa shigoto ni shūchū dekiru kankyō o totonoeru koto ga muzukashii koto mo aru. Kigyō wa tan ni shisutemu o dōnyū suru dake de naku, shain no mentarukea ya hyōka seido no minaoshi mo okonau hitsuyō ga arō.",
