    "romaji": "Saikin, AI no shinka ni yotte, watashitachi no seikatsu wa hijou ni benri ni natta. Sumaatofon no onsei ninshiki ya jidou hon'yaku nado, katsute wa yume datta gijutsu ga nichijou no mono to natte iru. Shikashi, benrisa o tsuikyuu suru amari, nani demo kikai ni tayori sugiru to, ningen ga mizukara kangae, handan suru chikara ga otoroete shimau no dewa nai darou ka. Gijutsu no onkei o kyouju shinagara mo, douji ni jibun no atama o ugokasu doryoku o wasurete wa naranai.",
